[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 125.",
    "start": 0.55,
    "end": 3.342,
    "zh": "第125课。",
    "zh_hant": "第125課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Tea for two.",
    "start": 3.392,
    "end": 5.172,
    "zh": "两人喝茶。",
    "zh_hant": "兩人喝茶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.233,
    "end": 10.535,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Does Susan have tea by herself?",
    "start": 11.236,
    "end": 14.517,
    "zh": "苏珊是一个人喝茶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "蘇珊是一個人喝茶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Can't you come in and have tea now, Peter?",
    "start": 16.418,
    "end": 20.58,
    "zh": "彼得，你现在难道不能进来喝茶吗？",
    "zh_hant": "彼得，你現在難道不能進來喝茶嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Not yet.",
    "start": 20.96,
    "end": 22.181,
    "zh": "还不行。",
    "zh_hant": "還不行。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I must water the garden first.",
    "start": 22.521,
    "end": 25.362,
    "zh": "我得先给花园浇水。",
    "zh_hant": "我得先給花園澆水。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Do you have to water it now?",
    "start": 25.763,
    "end": 28.784,
    "zh": "你现在非得浇水吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你現在非得澆水嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I'm afraid I must.",
    "start": 29.485,
    "end": 31.425,
    "zh": "恐怕必须得浇。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕必須得澆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Look at it!",
    "start": 31.646,
    "end": 32.806,
    "zh": "看看它！",
    "zh_hant": "看看它！"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "It's terribly dry.",
    "start": 33.006,
    "end": 35.207,
    "zh": "干得厉害。",
    "zh_hant": "幹得厲害。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "What a nuisance!",
    "start": 35.428,
    "end": 37.508,
    "zh": "真麻烦！",
    "zh_hant": "真麻煩！"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Last summer it was very dry, too.",
    "start": 37.989,
    "end": 41.471,
    "zh": "去年夏天也很干。",
    "zh_hant": "去年夏天也很乾。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Don't you remember?",
    "start": 41.931,
    "end": 43.572,
    "zh": "你不记得了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你不記得了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I had to water it every day.",
    "start": 44.273,
    "end": 47.094,
    "zh": "我每天都得浇水。",
    "zh_hant": "我每天都得澆水。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Well, I'll have tea by myself.",
    "start": 47.475,
    "end": 51.497,
    "zh": "那好吧，我就一个人喝茶。",
    "zh_hant": "那好吧，我就一個人喝茶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "That was quick!",
    "start": 52.677,
    "end": 54.378,
    "zh": "真快！",
    "zh_hant": "真快！"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Have you finished already?",
    "start": 54.659,
    "end": 57.04,
    "zh": "你已经浇完了？",
    "zh_hant": "你已經澆完了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 57.38,
    "end": 58.28,
    "zh": "是的。",
    "zh_hant": "是的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "Look out of the window.",
    "start": 58.621,
    "end": 60.662,
    "zh": "看看窗外。",
    "zh_hant": "看看窗外。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It's raining!",
    "start": 61.322,
    "end": 63.143,
    "zh": "下雨了！",
    "zh_hant": "下雨了！"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "That means you don't need",
    "start": 63.423,
    "end": 66.245,
    "zh": "这意味着你不需要",
    "zh_hant": "這意味著你不需要"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "to water the garden.",
    "start": 66.005,
    "end": 67.986,
    "zh": "给花园浇水。",
    "zh_hant": "給花園澆水。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "That was a pleasant surprise.",
    "start": 68.826,
    "end": 71.588,
    "zh": "真是个惊喜。",
    "zh_hant": "真是個驚喜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "It means I can have tea, instead.",
    "start": 72.248,
    "end": 75.49,
    "zh": "这意味着我可以改喝茶了。",
    "zh_hant": "這意味著我可以改喝茶了。"
  }
]
